000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PRMBILL.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE MAINFRAME BILLING.
000400*================================================================
000500* PRMBILL  DAILY BILLING FILE                    PRMNIGHT STEP030
000600*
000700* READS CORV.PRM.RATED (RATEREC) AND WRITES ONE BILLREC PER RATED
000800* POLICY TO CORV.PRM.BILLING.DAILY(+1), LRECL 64. RECORDS WITH A
000900* RATING RETURN CODE OF 90 OR MORE GO TO THE REJECTS REPORT AND
001000* ARE NOT BILLED. REFERRED POLICIES ARE STILL BILLED; UNDERWRITING
001100* REVIEWS THEM FROM THE REFERRALS REPORT THE NEXT MORNING.
001200* THE BILLING FILE HAS NO HEADER OR TRAILER: CONTROL TOTALS GO TO
001300* SYSOUT ONLY (warehouse-loader CHECKS THE RECORD COUNT AGAINST
001400* ITS OWN COUNT AND STORES IT IN dw.billing_load).
001500*================================================================
001600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001800 FILE-CONTROL.
001900     SELECT RATED-FILE ASSIGN TO RATED
002000         FILE STATUS IS WS-RATED-FS.
002100     SELECT BILLING-FILE ASSIGN TO BILLING
002200         FILE STATUS IS WS-BILLING-FS.
002300     SELECT REJECT-FILE ASSIGN TO REJECTS.
002400     SELECT REFER-FILE ASSIGN TO REFERRAL.
002500 DATA DIVISION.
002600 FILE SECTION.
002700 FD  RATED-FILE
002800     RECORDING MODE IS F.
002900     COPY RATEREC.
003000 FD  BILLING-FILE
003100     RECORDING MODE IS F.
003200     COPY BILLREC.
003300 FD  REJECT-FILE.
003400 01  REJECT-LINE                 PIC X(133).
003500 FD  REFER-FILE.
003600 01  REFER-LINE                  PIC X(133).
003700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003800 01  WS-FILE-STATUS.
003900     05  WS-RATED-FS             PIC X(02).
004000     05  WS-BILLING-FS           PIC X(02).
004100 01  WS-EOF-SW                   PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
004200     88  WS-EOF                  VALUE 'Y'.
004300 01  WS-TOTALS.
004400     05  WS-BILLED-CNT           PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
004500     05  WS-REJECT-CNT           PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
004600     05  WS-REFER-CNT            PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
004700     05  WS-GBP-PREMIUM          PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004800     05  WS-USD-PREMIUM          PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004900     05  WS-GBP-IPT              PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
005000 01  WS-REPORT-LINE.
005100     05  FILLER                  PIC X(01) VALUE SPACE.
005200     05  WS-RL-POLICY            PIC X(12).
005300     05  FILLER                  PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
005400     05  WS-RL-LINE              PIC X(03).
005500     05  FILLER                  PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
005600     05  WS-RL-REASON            PIC X(40).
005700     05  FILLER                  PIC X(73) VALUE SPACES.
005800 01  WS-EDIT-CNT                 PIC Z(8)9.
005900 01  WS-EDIT-AMT                 PIC Z(12)9.99-.
006000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
006100 0000-MAIN.
006200     OPEN INPUT RATED-FILE
006300          OUTPUT BILLING-FILE REJECT-FILE REFER-FILE
006400     PERFORM 8000-READ-RATED
006500     PERFORM 2000-BILL UNTIL WS-EOF
006600     PERFORM 9000-TOTALS
006700     CLOSE RATED-FILE BILLING-FILE REJECT-FILE REFER-FILE
006800     GOBACK.
006900 2000-BILL.
007000     IF RATE-RETURN-CODE >= 90
007100         MOVE RATE-POL-NUMBER TO WS-RL-POLICY
007200         MOVE RATE-LINE-CODE TO WS-RL-LINE
007300         MOVE 'NOT RATED - NO RATING PROGRAM' TO WS-RL-REASON
007400         WRITE REJECT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-LINE
007500         ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
007600     ELSE
007700         PERFORM 2100-WRITE-BILL
007800         IF RATE-REFER
007900             MOVE RATE-POL-NUMBER TO WS-RL-POLICY
008000             MOVE RATE-LINE-CODE TO WS-RL-LINE
008100             MOVE 'REFERRED - BILLED, UNDERWRITER TO REVIEW'
008200               TO WS-RL-REASON
008300             WRITE REFER-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-LINE
008400             ADD 1 TO WS-REFER-CNT
008500         END-IF
008600     END-IF
008700     PERFORM 8000-READ-RATED.
008800 2100-WRITE-BILL.
008900     MOVE SPACES            TO BILL-RECORD
009000     MOVE RATE-POL-NUMBER   TO POLICY-NO
009100     MOVE RATE-LINE-CODE    TO LINE-CODE
009200     MOVE RATE-BILL-DATE    TO BILL-DATE
009300     MOVE RATE-NET-PREMIUM  TO PREMIUM-AMT
009400     MOVE RATE-IPT-AMT      TO IPT-AMT
009500     MOVE RATE-CURRENCY     TO BILL-CURRENCY
009600     MOVE RATE-REGION       TO REGION
009700     WRITE BILL-RECORD
009800     ADD 1 TO WS-BILLED-CNT
009900     IF RATE-CURRENCY = 'GBP'
010000         ADD RATE-NET-PREMIUM TO WS-GBP-PREMIUM
010100         ADD RATE-IPT-AMT TO WS-GBP-IPT
010200     ELSE
010300         ADD RATE-NET-PREMIUM TO WS-USD-PREMIUM
010400     END-IF.
010500 8000-READ-RATED.
010600     READ RATED-FILE
010700         AT END SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
010800     END-READ.
010900 9000-TOTALS.
011000     MOVE WS-BILLED-CNT TO WS-EDIT-CNT
011100     DISPLAY 'PRMBILL CONTROL TOTALS'
011200     DISPLAY '  RECORDS BILLED    ' WS-EDIT-CNT
011300     MOVE WS-REJECT-CNT TO WS-EDIT-CNT
011400     DISPLAY '  RECORDS REJECTED  ' WS-EDIT-CNT
011500     MOVE WS-REFER-CNT TO WS-EDIT-CNT
011600     DISPLAY '  RECORDS REFERRED  ' WS-EDIT-CNT
011700     MOVE WS-GBP-PREMIUM TO WS-EDIT-AMT
011800     DISPLAY '  GBP PREMIUM       ' WS-EDIT-AMT
011900     MOVE WS-GBP-IPT TO WS-EDIT-AMT
012000     DISPLAY '  GBP IPT           ' WS-EDIT-AMT
012100     MOVE WS-USD-PREMIUM TO WS-EDIT-AMT
012200     DISPLAY '  USD PREMIUM       ' WS-EDIT-AMT
012300     IF WS-REJECT-CNT > ZERO
012400         MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
012500     END-IF.
